{"type":"message","id":"1baaf5c3","parentId":"706faffd","timestamp":"2026-04-02T03:40:19.752Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Thu 2026-04-02 11:40 GMT+8] An async command did not run.\nDo not run the command again.\nThere is no new command output.\nDo not mention, summarize, or reuse output from any earlier run in this session.\n\nExact completion details:\nExec denied (gateway id=6ef5c2c0-4599-4127-b961-c2f736058d7b, approval-timeout): set -e\nrepo=openclaw/openclaw\nfor n in 54952 54964 55008 55013; do\n  echo \"===== ISSUE $n =====\"\n  timeout 15s gh api repos/$repo/issues/$n/comments --paginate --jq '.[] | [.created_at, .updated_at, .user.login, .html_url, .body] | @tsv' || echo \"ERR issue-comments $n\"\n  if gh api repos/$repo/pulls/$n >/dev/null 2>&1; then\n    echo \"===== PR REVIEWS $n =====\"\n    timeout 15s gh api repos/$repo/pulls/$n/reviews --paginate --jq '.[] | [.submitted_at, .user.login, .html_url, .state, .body] | @tsv' || echo \"ERR pr-reviews $n\"\n    echo \"===== PR REVIEW COMMENTS $n =====\"\n    timeout 15s gh api repos/$repo/pulls/$n/comments --paginate --jq '.[] | [.created_at, .updated_at, .user.login, .html_url, .body] | @tsv' || echo \"ERR pr-comments $n\"\n  fi\n  echo\n done\n\nReply to the user in a helpful way.\nExplain that the command did not run and why.\nDo not claim there is new command output."}],"timestamp":1775101219707}}
